# Shared Components

Build in `src/components/` — not `components/ui/` (shadcn only).

## Required shared components (build in Phase 0)

| Component | Props pattern | Do not duplicate in features |
|-----------|---------------|------------------------------|
| `PageHeader` | title, description?, actions? | page title rows |
| `EmptyState` | icon?, title, description, action? | empty list messages |
| `ErrorAlert` | error: ApiError \| Error | error displays |
| `LoadingSkeleton` | variant: page \| table \| card | loading states |
| `CursorPagination` | meta, onNext, onPrev | pagination controls |
| `ConfirmDialog` | title, description, onConfirm | delete/void confirms |
| `ReadOnlyBanner` | — | subscription lapsed |
| `DataTable` | columns, data, isLoading | table + skeleton |

## When to add a new shared component

Extract when the **same UI pattern appears in 2+ features**. Keep feature-specific variants in `features/{Name}/components/`.

## shadcn install before custom markup

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add table dialog alert-dialog sheet tabs sidebar breadcrumb
```

Customize via Tailwind + `cn()` — never edit `components/ui/` source.
